🇺🇸🇮🇱 On Analyzing Netanyahu's Performance at the UNGA

▪️Israel is a US proxy selected to play the villain and to be run into the dirt to advance US interests in the region & around the globe;

▪️Performering proxies like Netanyahu exist to stick themselves out in the open, attract as much attention and hatred as possible, but also resonate as much as possible with anyone morally devoid enough to openly support US-backed aggression, war, and genocide - and most of all - emotionally rile and provoke targets of US manipulation and aggression - both the global public and the governments and military leadership of targeted nations;

▪️Interpreting Israel's words and actions as anything but geopolitical "reality TV" rather than examining the material reality of its subordination to and use by the US to advance it objectives in the region and around the world, is to fall directly into the trap the US has set using Israel for this role in the first place;

▪️Other political performers, like US presidents (especially Trump who actually performed in scripted "reality TV" shows and live performances with World Wrestling Entertainment for years before becoming "president"), the EU "leadership," and literal actors and clowns like Ukraine's Zelensky (he was an actual actor/comedian before becoming "president" of Ukraine) play similar roles and should be analyzed in this context rather than as "leaders" with any degree of agency or actual political power;

▪️Real policy and decisions are made by multi-billion dollar multi-nations corporations through a network of policy think tanks and massive lobbying, influence, and media networks simply using these politicians as layer of interface with and insulation from the general public - the fact many people, including many analysts, regularly forget this and instead obsess over these political performers is a daily reminder of how efficient this system of perception management actually is;
